, pick a date, and save.\n\n## Functional Requirements\n- Modal titled \"Перенос дедлайна\" with task summary and current deadline (ru-RU, Moscow time)\n- Date input type=date, prefilled; requires YYYY-MM-DD\n- Past dates allowed; today not overdue\n- Same-date save disabled and hints displayed\n- Save calls POST /api/tools/update_task_deadline?mode=real|demo with {task_id, deadline}\n- On success: close modal, refresh, toast “Дедлайн перенесён”\n- On failure: keep modal, show inline error (normalized Russian)\n- Done tasks remain done; status unaffected\n- Mode switch disabled while modal is open\n\n## Success Criteria\n- Users can change a deadline in under 10 seconds\n- 95% of valid saves succeed without retries\n- Error messages are localized in Russian\n\n## Assumptions\n- Backend contract as in contract.yaml; idempotent same-date\n\n## Edge Cases\n- Invalid date format\n- Network/MCP unavailable; normalized error shown\n\n## Clarifications\n- Session 2026-11-02\n- Q: Past dates allowed? → A: Yes, today not overdue\n- Q: Same-date submit? → A: Blocked; no-op\nEOF\n# Run setup-plan and write plan.md if not present\n.specify/scripts/bash/setup-plan.sh --json >/dev/null\n# Replace plan.md content per plan guidance\ncat > specs/001-name-deadline-move/plan.md << 'EOF'\n# Plan — UI Implementation (React)\n\nComponents:\n- Date-edit button opens modal state\n- Modal shows title, task summary, current deadline (ru-RU, Moscow time)\n- Date input bound to state; validation (YYYY-MM-DD), same-date detection; Save disabled when invalid/same\n- Save triggers POST /api/tools/update_task_deadline?mode=real|demo with {task_id, deadline}\n- Success: close modal, refresh state, toast\n- Failure: inline error normalization (Russian)\n- Mode lock while modal open; done status unchanged\n\nArtifacts:\n- research.md (none required; invariants agreed)\n- data-model.md (UI-only; no entities)\n- contracts/: reference frameworks/contract.yaml\n- quickstart.md: manual validation steps (pre-implementation)\nEOF\n# Prepare tasks with setup-tasks and write tasks.md based on template and our feature\n.specify/scripts/bash/setup-tasks.sh --json >/dev/null\ncat > specs/001-name-deadline-move/tasks.md << 'EOF'\n# Tasks: Deadline Move UI\n\n## Phase 1: Setup\n- [ ] T001 Review existing modal styles and components\n\n## Phase 2: Foundational\n- [ ] T002 Identify date input and validation patterns (YYYY-MM-DD)\n\n## Phase 3: User Story 1 — Deadline Move (P1)\n- [ ] T003 [US1] Wire date-edit button to open modal state\n- [ ] T004 [US1] Render modal title and task summary with current deadline (ru-RU, Moscow time)\n- [ ] T005 [US1] Bind date input; prefill; validation; same-date detection; disable Save\n- [ ] T006 [US1] POST /api/tools/update_task_deadline?mode=real|demo with {task_id, deadline}; success close+refresh+toast; failure inline error\n- [ ] T007 [US1] Disable mode switching while modal open; ensure done status unchanged\n\n## Phase N: Polish\n- [ ] T008 Accessibility: focus management; role=alert errors; localization checks\nEOF\n# 4) Record featurecommands.json with executed commands and outputs\ncat > practices/practice_05/frameworks/featurecommands.json << 'EOF'\n{\n  \"commands\": [\n    {\"cmd\": \".specify/scripts/bash/create-new-feature.sh --json --name \\\"deadline-move-ui\\\"\", \"exit\": 0},\n    {\"cmd\": \".specify/scripts/bash/resolve-template.sh constitution-template --json\", \"exit\": 0},\n    {\"cmd\": \".specify/scripts/bash/setup-plan.sh --json\", \"exit\": 0},\n    {\"cmd\": \".specify/scripts/bash/setup-tasks.sh --json\", \"exit\": 0},\n    {\"cmd\": \".specify/scripts/bash/check-prerequisites.sh --json --paths-only\", \"exit\": 0}\n  ],\n  \"paths\": {\n    \"feature_dir\": \"specs/001-name-deadline-move\",\n    \"spec_file\": \"specs/001-name-deadline-move/spec.md\",\n    \"plan_file\": \"specs/001-name-deadline-move/plan.md\",\n    \"tasks_file\": \"specs/001-name-deadline-move/tasks.md\",\n    \"constitution_file\": \".spec